# DEPRECATED - the uWSGI protocol is no longer used by the catalog app.
#
# This file used to hold uWSGI parameters for the uwsgi_pass blocks. The
# app now runs under Gunicorn and is proxied by Nginx over plain HTTP to
# unix:/catalog/socket/gunicorn.sock. The required HTTP proxy headers
# (Host, X-Real-IP, X-Forwarded-For, X-Forwarded-Proto, X-Forwarded-Host,
# X-Forwarded-Port) are defined inline in deploy/nginx/catalog-haproxy.conf
# and deploy/nginx/catalog.conf.
#
# The file is intentionally kept (content retired) only because
# staging.yml still lists it as a compose config source mounted into the
# nginx service at /catalog/uwsgi_params. Nothing includes it anymore.
# Once staging.yml is updated, this file can be deleted.
